# Locator HTTP demo requests
#
# This file can be used with IDE HTTP clients (for example, the built-in
# HTTP client in PhpStorm or VS Code extensions).
#
# Set the base URL in one place to quickly switch between environments.

@base = http://localhost:8000
@tenant = demo

### Service status

GET {{base}}/locator/status
Accept: application/json
X-SR-Tenant: {{tenant}}

### Address suggest – US (checkout-style query)

GET {{base}}/locator/address/suggest?query=1600%20Pennsylvania%20Ave%20NW%20Washington&country=US&limit=5
Accept: application/json
X-SR-Tenant: {{tenant}}

### Address suggest – GB (Downing Street)

GET {{base}}/locator/address/suggest?query=10%20Downing%20Street%20London&country=GB&limit=5
Accept: application/json
X-SR-Tenant: {{tenant}}

### Reverse geocoding – Houston, TX

GET {{base}}/locator/address/reverse?lat=29.7604&lon=-95.3698&country=US
Accept: application/json
X-SR-Tenant: {{tenant}}

### Reverse geocoding – Kyiv

GET {{base}}/locator/address/reverse?lat=50.4501&lon=30.5234&country=UA
Accept: application/json
X-SR-Tenant: {{tenant}}
